No.

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:12.221
Yeah, is this gonna

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:12.221
take a while?

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:16.058
Yes. 25 years ago,

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:16.058
before I was Dad,

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:21.564
I had this whole other life.

00:00:21.564 --> 00:00:24.233
<i>It was way back in 2005.</i>

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.111
<i>I was 27, just starting</i>

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.111
<i>to make it as an architect</i>

00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:28.487
<i>and living in New York</i>

00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:28.487
<i>with Marshall,</i>

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:29.822
<i>my best friend from college.</i>

00:00:29.822 --> 00:00:31.783
<i>My life was good.</i>

00:00:31.783 --> 00:00:34.535
<i>And then Uncle Marshall went</i>

00:00:31.783 --> 00:00:34.535
<i>and screwed the whole thing up.</i>

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.913
Will you marry me?

00:00:36.913 --> 00:00:38.790
Yes.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.125
Perfect!

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.125
